<title>FRANCE: Bouygues first quarter sales rise.</title>
<headline>Bouygues first quarter sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover			   14,000   vs   13,200</p>
<p>NOTE: Bouygues gave the figures in the BALO official bulletin. It said sales rose 1.5 percent at constant structure.</p>
